  "content": {
    "title": "关于学习《坚定历史自信 保持历史主动 续写历史新篇 --热烈庆祝中国共产党成立一百零一周年》的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2022-07-15",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">各位党员：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">　　<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">根椐流动党员支部学习计划，本周学习内容：人民日报社评论《</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">坚定历史自信</span></span></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">保持历史主动</span></span></span></span> <span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">续写历史新篇</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\"> --</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">热烈庆祝中国共产党成立一百零一周年</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left:16px; margin-right:16px\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">　　<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">学习形式：自学，各位党员要记好学习笔记。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>　　<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"background-color:white\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"color:#323b47\">特此通知。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n                ",
